19817 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This audit reviews Fermah Strata\054 a liquidity\055sensitive LMSR market\056 A Strata market implements a liquidity\055sensitive logarithmic market scoring rule \050LS\055LMSR\051 over N mutually exclusive outcomes\056 It operates on a buy\055only basis\072 participants spend stablecoins to acquire shares in a particular outcome\054 with each outcome\047s price representing its marginal probability\056 Upon resolution\054 each winning share can be redeemed for one unit of collateral\054 less a volume\055scaled settlement fee\056\nThe audit was conducted over two weeks and involved a comprehensive review of the relevant smart contracts\056\nDuring the assessment\054 we identified one high\055severity issue that allows an attacker to observe a market resolution transaction and front\055run it by purchasing shares in the winning outcome to capture profits\056 In addition\054 we identified one medium\055severity issue\054 three low\055severity issues\054 and ten informational issues\056\nAll identified issues were either remediated or acknowledged by the development team\054 and the corresponding fixes were subsequently verified by our auditors\056\nFollowing the remediation phase\054 we conclude that the audit has contributed to improving the protocol\047s overall security posture and code quality\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 19818 0 R
     /Pg 742 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

