20033 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As a result\054 when a market is resolved before its closeTime\054 the resolving transaction is the first public disclosure of the outcome\056 Anyone who sees it can place a buy on the winning outcome ahead of it\056 The gasless reportWithAuthorization\050\051 path makes this easier\072 the relayer holds the signed outcome and can buy first\054 then submit the signature\056\nThe front\055runner buys the winning shares at the pre\055resolution LMSR price and redeems them right after at close to 1 collateral per share\056\nNote that DisputeResolver\056\137openProposal\050\051 already accounts for this and pulls closeTime in before publishing a proposal\056 However\054 that happens in the same transaction\054 so a buy ordered before the propose transaction is still possible\054 and the attackers can still benefit from it\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
