20068 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The seed provider can make an underdog bet with no additional downside and use it to extract revenue that would otherwise go to the treasury and creator\056\nThe seed provider is the sponsored funder that posted the seed\054 or the creator of a self\055funded market \050in which case it only gives up its own creatorBps share of the house take\051\056\nThe issue is that the provider\047s losing bet is used to refill its own seed before the remaining funds are split between the treasury and creator\056 When the favourite\047s winners are owed more than the pot\054 the 95\045 floor in \137setSeedScale\050\051 caps their haircut and the seed pays the remaining shortfall\056 \137sweep\050\051 then refunds the seed from the recoverable balance\054 which includes losing stakes\054 before the house take is split\072)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 20069 0 R
     /Pg 4054 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

20069 0 obj
  << /K [ 20068 0 R ]
     /P 20076 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 4054 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

