20072 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This could create the following outcome\072\nIf the favourite wins\054 the provider\047s losing bet fills the seed shortfall that the seed would have paid anyway\054 so the bet costs it nothing \050up to the size of that shortfall\051\056\nIf the underdog wins\054 the provider receives its full seed back plus the betting payout\054 while the treasury and creator receive less house revenue\056\nThe provider therefore gets a free option on the underdog\054 funded by the house\056\nFor example\054 consider a binary market with alphaBps \075 300\054 bMin \075 10\054000 USDC \050seed 10\054000 USDC\051 and the default halfTaper\054 so b \075 bMin throughout\072\nBob bets 13\054000 USDC on YES and receives 19\054725\05637 shares\056 Carol then bets 4\054000 USDC on NO and receives 13\054636\05699 shares\056 The pot is 17\054000 USDC and YES is priced at 60\05640\045\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 20073 0 R
     /Pg 4054 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

