20113 0 obj
  << /ActualText (If YES wins\054 the provider\047s 1\054000 USDC NO bet loses and enters the pot\056 This reduces the seed\047s shortfall one\055for\055one\054 from 1\054369\05694 to 369\05694\054 so the provider loses its 1\054000 USDC bet but gets exactly 1\054000 USDC more of its seed back\056\nIf NO wins\054 the provider wins its bet\056 Because the seed is not needed to cover the NO winners\054 its 1\054355\05656 USDC profit comes out of funds that would otherwise contribute to the house take\054 which falls from 3\054631\05666 to 2\054276\05609 USDC\056\nA bet larger than the 1\054369\05694 shortfall is no longer free\072 at 2\054000 USDC\054 the provider loses 2\054000 instead of 1\054369\05694 if YES wins\056\nAs a result\054 a seed provider can repeatedly extract house revenue from qualifying markets while taking no additional risk\056 It only needs to trade from another address and place the bet shortly before the market closes\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 20114 0 R
     /Pg 4568 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
