20179 0 obj
  << /ActualText (However\054 it ignores when the stake entered and how long it was in the vault\056 A stake placed one minute before settlement\054 possibly never deposited\054 receives the same share as one that was in the vault for the whole market\056 Since depositToYield\050\051 also deposits the seed\054 which is not part of totalVolume\054 the seed\047s yield further enlarges the pool that late stakes can claim\056\nAs a result\054 anyone can enter shortly before settlement and take most of the yield accrued by earlier bettors\056\nFor example\054 when a market is voided\054 every stake is refunded at par\056 A late bettor therefore gets their entire stake back plus a stake\055weighted share of the yield\054 even though their capital was never deposited into the vault\054 or was deposited only for a short time\056 This is especially easy on a conditional market\072 once its condition has publicly failed but betting is still open\054 the void is certain\054 so the late stake carries no risk at all\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 20180 0 R
     /Pg 6900 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

