20248 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The protocol resolver fee is calculated in raw token units without accounting for the collateral\047s decimals\056 Since ResolverFeeConfig uses one global baseFee and perSecondRate\054 the fee is only correctly priced for one decimal width\056\nFor example\054 with baseFee \075 250\054000 and perSecondRate \075 4\054 a 90\055day market pays\072\nUSDC \0506 decimals\051\072 \176\04431\05635\nDAI \05018 decimals\051\072 \176\0440\056000000000031\nThus\054 an 18\055decimal stablecoin can effectively bypass the resolver fee\056\nRoot Cause\nThe fee is taken directly from the global configuration\072)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 20249 0 R
     /Pg 7954 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
