  << /ActualText (The second case is the only one in which the bettor loses\054 and it requires someone else to hold the exact realized cell\056 When the bettor is alone\054 or when bets are concentrated on a few cells\054 it rarely or never happens\056 The bettor therefore keeps the upside of the bet\054 which the seed pays for\054 while its downside is mostly removed by the void\056\nAs a result\054 a bettor can repeatedly take a positive\055expectation position against the seed in a thin liquidity market\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
