  << /ActualText (However\054 on a seeded market \050bMin \076 0\051\054 this does not hold when the amount owed to winners exceeds the pot\056 At resolution\054 \137setSeedScale\050\051 compares the nominal winner redemption with totalVolume\054 and scales every winning claim down by up to 5\045 when the pot does not cover it\072)
     /K [ 13 ]
