20493 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The resulting seedScaleBps is applied uniformly to every winning claim through \137seedScaled\050\051\054 and it is computed only from the final state of the market\056 Since a later bet on the winning outcome can increase unclaimedWinnerShares \050and therefore nominal\051 by more than it increases totalVolume\054 pushing nominal above the pot or lowering tight\056\nAs a result\054 a later bet on the same side can reduce the payout of an earlier winner by up to 5\045\054 even though the earlier winner\047s shares were fixed at purchase\056 The final payout of a position therefore cannot be determined from its purchase\055time price\054 which contradicts the documented \042no dilution\042 guarantee\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 20494 0 R
