20539 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As a result\054 the documented guarantees that only pooled stakes are routed to the vault\054 that the yield distribution and the seed refund are independent\054 and that the seed is refunded flat do not hold\072\nThe seed is exposed to vault losses\056 For example\054 a funder supplies a \04410\054000 seed and nobody bets\056 The operator calls depositToYield\050\051\054 and the vault loses 10\045\056 The funder receives only \0449\054000 back\054 despite no user ever betting\056\nThe seed\047s yield is not credited in proportion to the seed\056 The gross yield is split into yieldHandlingFee\054 which flows into the house take and reaches the creator only through its creatorBps share\054 and netYieldPool\054 which is distributed to bettors pro\055rata to their stake\056 Bettors therefore receive most of the yield generated by the seed\054 and the seed provider\047s share does not scale with the capital it supplied\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 20540 0 R
     /Pg 15442 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

