20691 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The bond has no upper cap\056 With bondBps \075 100\054 disputing a 10M USDC market requires a 100\054000 USDC bond \050which is a significant amount of money for a person\051\056\nHowever\054 the disputer has little reason to post it\054 even when the proposal is wrong\072\nA correct dispute only gets its bond back\056 In arbitrate\050\051\054 an overturned proposal calls \137refundBond\050\051 and nothing more\054 so there is no reward for the disputer\056\nA correct dispute can still lose the bond\056 If the arbiters do not rule within arbiterTimeout\054 \137closeWindow\050\051 finalizes the original proposal and calls \137forfeitBond\050\051 regardless of whether the dispute was right\072)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 20692 0 R
     /Pg 18690 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

