  << /ActualText (\057\057\057 \100dev The shared body of a buy\054 run before collateral is pulled\072 validates\n\057\057\057      the market is open and the outcome is in range\054 prices the stake\054\n\057\057\057      enforces the slippage guard\054 records \140shares\140 of \140outcome\140 against\n\057\057\057      \140buyer\140\047s position\054 advances the book and volume\054 and emits\n\057\057\057      \173Bought\175\056 The caller performs the collateral transfer last \050CEI\051\054 so\n\057\057\057      a failed transfer reverts these writes\056\n\057\057\057 \100dev Enforces the optional betting allowlist\056 A zero \140allowlist\140 is\n\057\057\057      permissionless and short\055circuits before any external call \056\056\056\nfunction \137requireBettorAllowed\050\n    address buyer\n\051 internal view \173\n    \056\056\056\n\175\n\nfunction \137credit\050\n    address buyer\054\n    uint256 outcome\054\n    uint256 stake\054\n    uint256 minSharesOut\054\n    address sponsor\n\051 internal returns \050uint256 shares\051 \173)
